{
  "_comment": "Hand-curated mappings from TGA ARTG ingredient names to N of 1 registry moiety names.",
  "_format": "{ 'artg name (lowercase)': { 'target': 'Registry moietyName (exact)', 'verified': false } }",
  "_instructions": [
    "All seeds start with verified: false. A seed 'fires' when its key appears in a real ARTG export.",
    "The ingest script reports: seeds that fired+resolved | fired+broken target | never fired.",
    "Unfired seeds hide plausible-but-wrong mappings — review them after each ingest run.",
    "Change verified to true only after you have confirmed the mapping against real ARTG data.",
    "Keys must be lowercase. Values in 'target' must match the moietyName field in moiety-registry.ts EXACTLY.",
    "Wrong target: the key fires in the ARTG data but the moiety lookup silently fails — ingredient appears unmatched.",
    "Add new mappings here. Re-run: npx tsx scripts/ingest-artg-export.ts <export> --out candidates.json"
  ],
